    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Preparing food


    Jack was hungry. He walked to the kitchen. He got
    out some eggs. He took out some oil. He placed a skillet on the stove. Next,
    he turned on the heat. He poured the oil into the skillet. He cracked the eggs
    into a bowl. He stirred the eggs. Then, he poured them into the hot skillet.
    He waited while the eggs cooked. They cooked for two minutes. He heard them cooking.
    They popped in the oil.


    Next, Jack put the eggs on a plate. He placed the
    plate on the dining room table. Jack loved looking at his eggs. They looked pretty
    on the white plate. He sat down in the large wooden chair. He thought about the
    day ahead. He ate the eggs with a spoon. They were good.


    He washed the
    plate with dishwashing soap. Then, he washed the pan. He got a sponge damp. Finally,
    he wiped down the table. Next, Jack watched TV.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
